Lab ninety-one gives you a project and an empty repository server with a web page.

139
00:06:09,563 --> 00:06:11,253
Lab check judges your work.

140
00:06:11,803 --> 00:06:13,990
It lives at git hub dot com,

141
00:06:13,990 --> 00:06:15,552
slash it dash waves,

142
00:06:15,552 --> 00:06:17,348
slash dev ops dash A I,

143
00:06:17,348 --> 00:06:18,207
in academy,

144
00:06:18,207 --> 00:06:18,519
lab,

145
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:20,315
lab ninety-one dot S H.

146
00:06:20,865 --> 00:06:22,067
One: open the web page,

147
00:06:22,067 --> 00:06:22,432
log in,

148
00:06:22,432 --> 00:06:24,104
and create the two repositories,

149
00:06:24,104 --> 00:06:25,149
corp dash snapshots,

150
00:06:25,149 --> 00:06:26,350
and corp dash releases,

151
00:06:26,350 --> 00:06:27,969
with the right type and policy.

152
00:06:28,519 --> 00:06:30,781
Two: set the variable corp pass from the password file,

153
00:06:30,781 --> 00:06:31,767
and deploy the snapshot,

154
00:06:31,767 --> 00:06:33,042
with dash s settings dot X M L.

155
00:06:33,592 --> 00:06:38,925
Three: change the version to one dot zero dot zero, and deploy the release.

156
00:06:39,475 --> 00:06:40,013
Four: deploy it again.

157
00:06:40,013 --> 00:06:40,330
It must fail.

158
00:06:40,330 --> 00:06:41,380
Save the error line into conflict dot text.

159
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:42,528
Then find a rejected upload on the events page,

160
00:06:42,528 --> 00:06:43,529
and write its event I D into ui dot text.

161
00:06:44,079 --> 00:06:45,769
Five: publish one dot zero dot one,

162
00:06:45,769 --> 00:06:47,653
and write one sentence in why dot text,

163
00:06:47,653 --> 00:06:49,827
about why a release is never published twice.

164
00:06:49,827 --> 00:06:50,841
Use the word release.

165
00:06:51,391 --> 00:06:52,572
Install a J D K,

166
00:06:52,572 --> 00:06:54,711
Maven and python three first.

167
00:06:54,711 --> 00:06:55,597
Then lab up,

168
00:06:55,597 --> 00:06:56,334
lab check,

169
00:06:56,334 --> 00:06:57,294
and lab down.

170
00:06:57,294 --> 00:07:00,392
The shortcut file is shortcuts ninety-one.

171
00:07:00,392 --> 00:07:02,827
The check downloads plugins once,

172
00:07:02,827 --> 00:07:03,786
so be online.

173
00:07:05,836 --> 00:07:07,905
Pass or fail. You need all six.

174
00:07:08,455 --> 00:07:10,269
Five pass lines in lab check.

175
00:07:10,819 --> 00:07:12,803
You can explain snapshot and release.

176
00:07:13,353 --> 00:07:16,190
You can explain why the second release deploy fails.

177
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:19,215
The fix is a new version, never an overwrite.

178
00:07:19,765 --> 00:07:21,727
You created both repositories in the web page.

179
00:07:22,277 --> 00:07:24,197
lab down, nothing left behind.

180
00:07:24,747 --> 00:07:26,049
To pass, all six.

181
00:07:28,099 --> 00:07:30,936
Your turn, in your own Ubuntu virtual machine.

182
00:07:31,486 --> 00:07:33,577
One: lab up, and read the task file.

